aib.newproj.pack_body:
This seat is now bound to the project 「{title}」. From now on, work from the handoff pack below.

{text}
── Reply with one line: {value}

codex_trust.body:
AIB just installed these Codex hooks; Codex runs them only once trusted:
{items}

No answer in 30 seconds counts as Agree.

aib.nowgate.block:
aib-now-gate: @{code} did work this turn but the 📌 status was not updated (last update: {when}).
This seat has the status check turned on: after each stage, before handing back to a person, update the status line first. Run:
  {cmd}
On screen now: {line}

aib.sits.no_socket:
EZ2_AIHUB_SOCKET is not set. Batch seat opening does not guess the cabin — one wrong guess opens five seats in the wrong place.
  existing sockets: {detail}
  e.g. EZ2_AIHUB_SOCKET=aihub-16 aib 5sits

aib.newproj.persona_first:
Seat {seat} has no persona yet, and a project folder can only be bound after the persona. Bind one first, then rerun this command:
  aib newrole --name "<persona name>" --prompt-file <persona.md> --seat {seat} --actor {actor}
(an existing persona only needs --name; a new one also needs the persona text)

aib.chat.requests_row:
{when}  {name} ({country}) "{note}"
  accept: aib chat request accept {owner}
  reject: aib chat request reject {owner}

aib.chat.pair_show:
In the phone's Nostr app (0xchat / Amethyst / Primal) add this key: {npub}
Send one private message containing only: {code}
Valid for {minutes} minutes; then Touch ID will pop up here. Compare the start and end of the key shown in the phone app before you touch

aib.chat.join_code:
Pairing code: {code}
On the machine holding the owner key run: aib chat devices add {code}
It will show the fingerprint {fp}; check it matches. Valid for {minutes} minutes
